OL,3,GNEWSAParents Group leader faces #42,000
OL,4,Abill for failed legal action against
OL,5,Acouncil
OL,6,
OL,7,FA woman is facing a #42,000 bill for
OL,8,Fchallenging Glasgow City Council's
OL,9,Fbudget in court.
OL,11,FLeanne McGuire, former chairwoman of
OL,12,FGlasgow City Parents Group (GCPG), led
OL,13,Fa failed legal bid for a judicial
OL,14,Freview of the council's budget over the
OL,15,Fproposed cut of teacher jobs.
OL,17,FCouncil leader Ricky Bell said the
OL,18,Fcouncil has a duty to "protect the
OL,19,Fpublic purse" and recoup expenses
OL,20,Ffollowing the court proceedings.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
